      "content": "Thanks for starting that. It's a bit short though, and I noticed the score was only halfway to where it needs to be. My supervisor is really strict about seeing the breadth of the field reflected in the actual text. \n\nCan you expand this into a much more detailed, multi-paragraph academic review? Please try to weave in as many of those names as possible throughout the different sections of the synthesis. I need the coverage score to be as close to the max as possible so it looks like I've done the work. Just make sure it stays looking like a professional academic paper.",
